"""Mutations of part 7g's air attack (src/game/air_attack.*) for ../mutfast.py with the actors build:

    python mutfast.py mutations/mutate_7g.py --models DIR --build build_item.bat --check check_item.py

Each should make check_item.py fail (or the harness crash / hang). Generated from the sources (a
comparison, a number, an operator or a statement per line), then pruned. Left out as equivalent
(55): NormalizeBy's / LengthOf's exact-1 and 1e-8 limits and the sign tests of their degenerate
branches (< against <= on a component known not to be 0); the aim's up / side normalisations, the
up vector's 1000 and the direction normalised again in Fire (side always comes out along
(d.z, 0, -d.x): only its scale changes, normalised away), StartMission's first normalisation (the
levelled direction is normalised again: rounding only); ties the code never meets (the 0.04 left
past a border, levelling to exactly 0, a dive levelled past 0 (it cannot be), the bank and the
height reaching the target exactly, a roll of exactly pi, the dust timer's 0 / 1); rates of
exactly 0.5 (the code sets 0, 0.75, +-0.4, and climbs by whole slopes); a member set again before
use (SetTarget's ceiling, the flash time, the S_Bullet / S_Dust / S_Flash defaults, the
C_AirAttack defaults StartMission resets, a new sound's position 0, toTarget without a target);
the w of a ray (ahead, the sight's, the squads' and the shot's: never read); the bullets' and
flashes' delete loops (a leak) and the creator's lambda return. 9 more did not compile (a
duplicate case value, header enums and a static_assert) and were dropped.

Results (2026-10-30): the first run caught 546 of 713 (9 did not compile, 158 survived). New cases:
StartMission from garbage fields (every one reset, the state kept shot down, no target), a box centre
off 0, a frame z axis mostly up and none; tiny / zero dust directions (each axis, either sign);
the motor's pitch and on, the motor swap's off / on (a seed choosing another motor), the ceiling
set again; the pooled sounds' calls (on, play, pitch, link, loop, update, IsPlaying's argument);
the gun sound's on, exactly 400 m standing still, a fade from 0.5; the whizz at exactly 10 m, 11 m
along z, 9.9 m; two bullets with the first landing; a flash at 0 the next update and flash 0;
the in-sight flag cleared in every other state; gone without smoke with live dust; walls with
normal y 0 / 0.5 and at exactly 1 m / 0 m (LengthOf); a climb from y 0.2, a slight climb levelled
past 0; the target's height reached, climbed to from 0.1, and low while in sight; straight ahead
and slightly off; a shot exactly due and single shots' exact rays and bullet times; a dust timer at
1 ms, the dust effect's flags; save with state 3, an empty bullets chunk and a chunk after it;
FindAirAttackFor with the gunner off the origin; an edge-on border along y and z; then the box's
update (centre, radius, inverse, move). Rerun of the 158: 99 caught; of the 59, 4 more with the
box case and 55 equivalent (above). A full rerun: all 649 caught."""
